{"counterArgument": "The cited evidence reflects transient sync bugs and niche power-user edge cases rather than a broad, unaddressed latent need for full desktop taxonomy parity. Review rev-00490e85 describes existing categories failing to display—a clear API sync or local caching bug—while rev-4bffdf11 demands template editing, an inherently complex desktop workflow ill-suited for mobile screens. Forcing complete desktop structural parity onto mobile risks severe UI bloat for the vast majority of users who rely on the app primarily for quick drafting and light publishing on the go."}

